OL,3,AChancellor rejects calls to raise
OL,4,ACapital Gains Tax in Budget, sources
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey has dismissed
OL,8,Fcalls from some Labour MPs to increase
OL,9,FCapital Gains Tax (CGT), according to
OL,10,Fsources.
OL,12,FCabinet ministers Wes Streeting and
OL,13,FLouise Haigh both previously voiced
OL,14,Fsupport for raising CGT before Andy
OL,15,FBurnham became prime minister in July.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
