OL,3,AJob vacancies fall as small firms cut
OL,4,Aback on recruitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FJob vacancies in the UK have seen their
OL,7,Flargest fall since the start of the
OL,8,Fyear as smaller businesses cut back on
OL,9,Frecruitment, official figures indicate.
OL,11,FVacancies fell by 21,000 in the three
OL,12,Fmonths to September to 691,000,
OL,13,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,14,FStatistics (ONS), which said small
OL,15,Ffirms were citing labour costs as a key
OL,16,Ffactor in scaling back hiring.
OL,18,FEnergy costs have risen since the Iran
OL,19,Fwar began, and companies have also said
OL,20,Fthat increases in National Insurance
OL,21,Fand the minimum wage have made it more
OL,22,Fexpensive to employ staff.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
