OL,3,AFrench cities calm overnight after
OL,4,Acurfews imposed to quell violence, PM
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FTargeted curfews across France
OL,8,Fcontributed to a quiet night following
OL,9,Fa weekend of riots and looting across
OL,10,Fthe country, the Prime Minister
OL,11,FSebastien Lecornu has said.
OL,13,FCurfews were introduced across parts of
OL,14,Fcentral Paris, including Place de la
OL,15,FRepublique, where protesters had
OL,16,Fgathered over the weekend, and the Les
OL,17,FHalles shopping area.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
