OL,3,AFrench cities calm overnight after
OL,4,Acurfews imposed to quell violence, PM
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FOther measures restricting the movement
OL,8,Fof young people and gatherings were
OL,9,Fintroduced in cities such as Marseille,
OL,10,FBordeaux, Nice and Lyon in the south,
OL,11,Fas well as Lille and other towns in the
OL,12,Fnorth.
OL,14,FLecornu thanked police officers and
OL,15,Fgendarmes for enforcing the measures,
OL,16,Fadding that further curfews on Tuesday
OL,17,Fnight would be decided depending on
OL,18,Fwhere they are necessary.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
