OL,3,ACanadian PM says Albertans have made a
OL,4,A'clear choice' to reject referendum on
OL,5,Aindependence
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I don't even consider myself to be
OL,8,FCanadian anymore," one voter tells the
OL,9,FBBC, while another calls the vote "a
OL,10,Fturning point in Canada's history"
OL,12,FSeparatists argue the province - which
OL,13,Fhas the fourth-largest oil reserves in
OL,14,Fthe world - has been overlooked by
OL,15,FOttawa
OL,17,FMeanwhile, indigenous Albertans have
OL,18,Fbeen working to block the vote for
OL,19,Fmonths, arguing separation would
OL,20,Fviolate land treaties
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
